# C8 anion addition: FREE CATALYST reference (chemzyme without the peroxide).
#
# Binding-energy reference for:
#   cat + HOO-  ->  [cat...HOO-]-        (Rs = geometry_b973c-xtb/rs_anion)
#
# Geometry built from rs_anion/job.xyz by DELETING the HOO- atoms {130,131,132},
# leaving the 130-atom system (116 host + the 14-atom ketone/ring QM region).
# The deleted fragment carried the -1, so this system is NEUTRAL.
#
# QM1 = the 14 atoms {55 58 61 64 120...129} (ketone C128=O129 + ring); QM2 =
# 116 host atoms at GFN2-xTB / GFN-FF topology, Hirshfeld embedding. Whole system
# ddCOSMO(water). Optimised + Freq in ONE job (G at 298.15 K).
#
# Charge convention: QM region charge on the *xyzfile line; Charge_total = whole
# system. QM 0, host 0, total 0.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129}
END
Charge_total 0
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 500
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
